# Disables ALL automatic line-ending conversion (autocrlf etc.) for this repo.
# The byte-identical content is a requirement: guard-upstream.sh and
# skills-integrity.sh compare working trees (submodule gitlink check is
# byte-based; skills-integrity.sh hashes every vendored file). A CRLF
# conversion on checkout on Windows would make the manifest paths end in CR
# (sha256sum "FAILED open or read") and break the guard on fresh clones.
* -text
